# Generated audio assets - NOT in git on purpose (keeps the repo text-only).
# They are produced from the committed generator scripts; run both before building:
#     python _gen_audio.py     (sfx_tap / sfx_select / sfx_back / sfx_tick + bgm take 1)
#     python _gen_bgm.py       (bgm_shell, seamless loop - overwrites the take-1 bgm)
# Requires ffmpeg with libvorbis on PATH. See BUILD.md, "Audio Assets".
# notif_chime.ogg has NO committed generator yet - see the note in BUILD.md.
app/src/main/res/raw/*.ogg
app/src/main/res/raw/*.wav
